cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
wait 1
cra://debug?systemAppearance=light
wait 1
cra://debug?systemAppearance=dark&themeShown=same-turn-dark
expect-log Cra theme shown same-turn-dark: space=Pastel follows=1 theme=dark shell=dark sidebar=dark .* card=veil=0\.35
